# Web Development Internship — Environment Configuration Template
# NOTE: The current projects use the Open-Meteo Public REST API (no API key required)
# and Client-Side State Architecture. All projects run out-of-the-box!
#
# If you wish to connect alternative commercial APIs, configure the keys below:
# ==============================================================================

# (Optional) Week 4: Alternative Weather API Keys
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweather_api_key_here
# WEATHERAPI_KEY=your_weatherapi_key_here

# (Optional) Week 5: Backend API Endpoint (if connecting a live backend)
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# PORT=8000
